\f1\fs22 As pub tests were applied in bars all through the Ghetto, some wizened old know-it-alls began claiming that no one who had attended Chanta\'92s famous penthouse Humpenings had got sick. That led to some pitch-fork reasoning that posited a conspiracy among the Elvi elites in government\'97
\f2\i they were making us sick 
\f1\i0 in some deep-state plot. Some even accused them of knowing Bill Gates, who in this universe had founded Microdose Vaccines and had been jailed several times for inventing chemtrails. Some slightly less crusty know-it-alls countered with evidence that Elvi who had slept with an Elvi who had slept with Chanta were all surviving whatever pox this was.\
Fights broke out; many Deaths in a Bathroom were spilled and many good pool cues were snapped. In the end, facts were facts. As more indirect connections of sexual relationships between any given Elvi and Chanta were being claimed and discovered, the hypothesis seemed to hold firm. A new study of humpology was born which was, of course, related to genealogy, but with vastly more datapoints. The Elvi Parliament asked (in writing that only a few scholars have claimed to be forged) if the Mormons would help them build a humpological database. The Mormons politely declined. Nevertheless, the Elvi pressed on and engaged the consulting firm Insulture who agreed to compile the database in return for the Elvi providing bands for their next nine-and-half Christmas parties (the High Elvis drew a hard line at ten). As an aside, after nine Christmas parties, Insulture sued  the Elvi when they refused to perform the following year. The Elvi won, arguing  that  a Christmas party that ran half as long still constituted a Christmas Party, not half a one.\
Few Elvi cared for science, even it it was called humpology. But they loved to play Six Degrees of Humping Chanta, which gained a foothold because any more than six degrees was said to be ineffective. Ideally three degrees was the longest connection that would prevent the need for yearly inoculation. Although this was all hearsay and rumour, many Elvi who suffered PTSD from the first year of Humpenings sought therapy for fear of yearly being arse-fucked five ways from Friday.\
\pard\pardeftab720\sl220\sb220\qj\partightenfactor0

\f0\fs24 \cf2 \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 <!$Scr_Ps::1><$Scr_Ps::0>
\f1\fs22 Pastor Rex Humble\'92s leather-soled shoes squeaked across the polished floor of the Memphis Mafia Bar & House of Worship\'97an unholy amalgamation that reflected the schizophrenic nature of his flock. He\'92d come to retrieve the sacramental water (actually just regular water in recycled bourbon bottles) when he noticed something peculiar: a line of kitchen staff fidgeting outside the stasis store.\
